# `make build` writes here.
/bin/

# `go build ./cmd/...` drops a binary per command in the working directory.
# Binaries are built, never tracked.
/pimctl
/tuiprobe
/doccheck

# goreleaser writes here.
/dist/

# macOS writes one of these into every directory it is shown.
.DS_Store

# The live-tenant envelope named in CLAUDE.md: whose tenant, which roles, which
# scopes. That belongs to whoever runs it, not to the repository.
CLAUDE.local.md
